# 11. Current Health Problem Intake

Immediately after login, the system asks:

> **“What problem are you currently experiencing?”**

This is the beginning of the pre-consultation clinical intake.

The patient can:

### Option A: Speak

The patient naturally describes the issue.

Example:

> “Mujhe teen din se pet mein dard hai.”

The speech system converts the patient's response into structured information.

### Option B: Select from options

The system presents large visual choices:

* Fever
* Pain
* Cough
* Headache
* Stomach pain
* Chest pain
* Weakness
* Injury
* Follow-up
* Other

### Option C: Combined voice and touch

The patient can switch between voice and touch at any point.

The original problem requires both natural spoken interaction and guided touchscreen interaction.

